From aca6d96353419f796682da412d659a86e4d9055b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <dev@infoverify.local>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 08:32:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Choose Service dropdown gate + red NOTE to
 Attestation/Newspaper, ship BVN CRM

Newspaper Publication and Birth Attestation now match the reference
design's own UX: a native <select> "Choose Service" dropdown gates the
form - fields don't render until the (single) option is picked. Birth
Attestation also gained the red NOTE banner from the reference
screenshot ("Dear customers, please be informed that only modifications
between 1 day and 5 years are allowed."), shown once that option is
selected.

BVN CRM (new): same manual-review pattern as BVN/NIN Modification
throughout - no provider API, so the customer's 8-digit TicketID
(88248XXX-shaped) is debited from the wallet, rendered to a submission
PDF, and left PENDING for an admin to follow up on by hand in the
background and mark complete via the Transaction resource (or reverse
to refund) - never manual outside the admin panel.

- New TransactionType value BVN_CRM (+ migration, ADD VALUE IF NOT
  EXISTS matching the existing attestation/newspaper migration's shape).
- bvn-crm.service.ts/.routes.ts: single fixed field (ticket_id, 8
  digits), price defaults to N2,000 via ServicePricing - same
  admin-editable-without-a-deploy row every other manual service uses
  (sellingPriceKobo overrides providerCostKobo, isActive can pull it).
- Admin wiring mirrors completeBirthAttestation/downloadBirthAttestationPdf
  exactly: completeBvnCrm/downloadBvnCrmPdf action pair on the
  Transaction resource, PENDING-reversal allowlist extended,
  TARGET_PATH_BY_TYPE in redirect-to-manage.tsx extended, SUPER_ADMIN-only
  audited PDF route registered in admin/setup.ts.
- Frontend: BvnCrmPage.tsx (/bvn-crm, services.ts flipped to
  implemented: true) - "Submit your 8 DIGITS TicketID looks like:
  88248XXX" field, "processed within 24 - 48hrs" copy, PIN-confirm +
  history/PDF-download shape matching every other manual-review page.

Verified: all 173 existing backend tests still pass unchanged. Frontend
tsc + vite build both clean. Backend tsc shows the same class of stale-
Prisma-client errors already present on birth-attestation.service.ts/
newspaper-publication.service.ts (this sandbox can't reach
binaries.prisma.sh to run prisma generate) - bvn-crm.service.ts has the
identical error shape/count, nothing new introduced. Running prisma
generate locally clears these the same way it always has.
